~ start
do CutsceneController.lock_input()
do CutsceneController.reset_textbox_color()
do CutsceneController.set_textbox_frame(0)
do CutsceneController.show_textbox()
if Statics.solid_at_world_pos(Vector2(248, 136))
	NPC8: There's something funny about\nthat tree...
else
	NPC8: I[wait=0.125] {{GlobalText.EFF_SHAKE}}knew[wait=0.125][/shake] there was something\nweird about that tree!!
=> END